</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thy holy head, once bound with thorns,</l><l>The crown of glory now adorns;</l><l>Thy seat, the Father’s throne.</l><l>O Lord, e’en now we sing Thy praise,</l><l>Ours the eternal song to raise,</l><l>Worthy the Lord alone!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We triumph in Thy triumphs, Lord,</l><l>Thy joys our deepest joys afford,</l><l>The fruit of love divine.</l><l>While sorrowing, suff’ring, toiling here,</l><l>How does the thought our spirits cheer,</l><l>The throne of glory’s Thine!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
